---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait/radin-khayyam.png';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Radin Khayyam studied electrical engineering at Sharif and is an MSc student in artificial intelligence at Koç University, working on learning theory with Prof. Zafer Doğan and on applications of AI."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I studied electrical engineering at Sharif University of Technology, and I am now an MSc student in artificial
      intelligence at Koç University. Learning theory is the primary track. Applications of AI are the second.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="split">
    <figure>
      <Image
        class="portrait"
        src={portrait}
        alt="Radin Khayyam"
        widths={[360, 720, 1080]}
        sizes="(min-width: 60rem) 288px, 80vw"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <figcaption class="portrait-cap">Radin Khayyam</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ol class="record">
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3>Sharif University of Technology</h3>
            <p>BSc in electrical engineering, Tehran. GPA 18.08/20.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="when">2020 to 2025</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3>Koç University</h3>
            <p>MSc in artificial intelligence, Istanbul, on the Presidential Fellowship.</p>
          </div>
          <p class="when">October 2026 to present</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Employment</h2>
    <ol class="record">
      <li>
        <div>
          <h3>Solico Group</h3>
          <p>
            AI engineer, full time. Applied machine learning for B2B ordering, and a shopping assistant built with
            retrieval-augmented generation and LoRA. The write-up is on <a href="/projects">Projects</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="when">August 2025 to September 2026</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <div>
          <h3>Atieh Clinic</h3>
          <p>
            Biomedical engineering intern. I implemented psychological tasks (Iowa Gambling, Random Dot Motion) in
            MATLAB and Psychtoolbox, and recorded and preprocessed EEG with EEGLAB.
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="when">July 2024 to September 2024</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Learning theory</h2>
    <p>
      This is the work I want the MSc to be about, and it is underway rather than finished. I work with Prof. Zafer
      Doğan in the MLIP group at Koç University. The questions are how models generalize, how classical learning theory
      meets modern deep models (transformers among them, and the effect of the optimizer), and how to learn from
      structured data instead of idealized i.i.d. samples. The longer account is on <a href="/research">Research</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Applications of AI</h2>
    <p>
      The second track is applied. One part is recommender systems and personalized AI, which is where the Solico Group
      work sits. The other is biomedical signal processing and AI in healthcare, which continues the EEG and
      brain-computer interface work from Sharif, the ICBME 2024 paper, and a remote internship at the University of
      British Columbia.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <h2>Selected honors</h2>
    <ul class="plain">
      <li>Koç University Presidential Fellowship, 2026.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="context-line">
      I also played table tennis for Iran’s national teams, including international junior and cadet tournaments from
      2017 to 2019: competitive work, held to a high standard. The
      <a href="/photos">photographs</a> and the <a href={site.sportsCv}>sports CV</a> keep that record.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
